 ('How many rak‘as is the first sunnah performed before the obligatory noon prayer?', 'Four', ['Two', 'Three', 'Six'], 'Four rak‘as of sunnah are performed before and two after the obligatory noon prayer.', 'Sunnah of the noon prayer'),
 ('How many rak‘as is the sunnah performed before the obligatory afternoon prayer?', 'Four', ['Two', 'Three', 'Eight'], 'Four rak‘as of (non-emphasised) sunnah are performed before the obligatory afternoon prayer.', 'Sunnah of the afternoon prayer'),
