 ('Praying in a cemetery is disliked.', 'A place of prayer should be clean and peaceful; praying in a cemetery is avoided.', 'Places where prayer is avoided'),
 ('It is sunnah to enter the mosque with the right foot first.', 'One enters the mosque with the right foot and leaves with the left.', 'Mosque etiquette'),
